KPL/IK

Instrument kernel for Libera
----------------------------------------------------------

    NOTE: Only the FOV and BORESIGHT variables are official IK variables. All
    others require manual reading from the SPICE variable pool.

    This file was created by LASP_SDS_TEAM.


Kernel data
----------------------------------------------------------

    Libera WFOV Camera (-143013010) - Science FOV
    ---------------------------------------------

        \begindata

        INS-143013010_FOV_SHAPE            = 'CIRCLE'
        INS-143013010_FOV_FRAME            = 'LIBERA_WFOV_CAM_COORD'
        INS-143013010_BORESIGHT            = ( 0.0 0.0 1.0 )
        INS-143013010_FOV_CLASS_SPEC       = 'ANGLES'
        INS-143013010_FOV_REF_VECTOR       = ( 1.0 0.0 0.0 )
        INS-143013010_FOV_REF_ANGLE        = 61.5
        INS-143013010_FOV_ANGLE_UNITS      = 'DEGREES'

        \begintext

    Libera Radiometer (-143013011) - Science FOV
    --------------------------------------------
        The four radiometer channels (SW, SSW, LW, TOT) are assumed co-aligned and
        share this single instrument definition.

        \begindata

        INS-143013011_FOV_SHAPE            = 'CIRCLE'
        INS-143013011_FOV_FRAME            = 'LIBERA_RAD_COORD'
        INS-143013011_BORESIGHT            = ( 0.0 0.0 1.0 )
        INS-143013011_FOV_CLASS_SPEC       = 'ANGLES'
        INS-143013011_FOV_REF_VECTOR       = ( 1.0 0.0 0.0 )
        INS-143013011_FOV_REF_ANGLE        = 1.0
        INS-143013011_FOV_ANGLE_UNITS      = 'DEGREES'

        \begintext

NAIF ID Code to Name Mapping
----------------------------------------------------------

    Instrument body name/id mappings.

        \begintext data

        NAIF_BODY_NAME += ( 'LIBERA_WFOV_CAM' )
        NAIF_BODY_CODE += ( -143013010 )

        NAIF_BODY_NAME += ( 'LIBERA_RAD' )
        NAIF_BODY_CODE += ( -143013011 )

        \begintext
